# Age of Mortals — races.
Tarmak	SIZE:M	MOVE:Walk,30	RACETYPE:Humanoid	RACESUBTYPE:Human	TYPE:Humanoid.PC	BONUS:STAT|STR|2	BONUS:STAT|CON|2	BONUS:STAT|INT|-2	BONUS:STAT|CHA|-2	AUTO:LANG|Common|Tarmak	FAVCLASS:Barbarian	STARTFEATS:1	SAB:War Paint: the Tarmak alone know the secret of their magical blue war paint (every Tarmak with 4 or more ranks of Craft (alchemy) knows it). See the Tarmak War Paint item.	DESC:The Brutes, savage warriors of Ansalon's east. +2 Strength, +2 Constitution, -2 Intelligence, -2 Charisma; Medium; base speed 30 feet. Automatic languages Tarmak and Common; bonus languages any. Favored class barbarian.	SOURCEPAGE:p.10-11
Half-Kender	SIZE:M	MOVE:Walk,30	RACETYPE:Humanoid	RACESUBTYPE:Human	TYPE:Humanoid.PC	BONUS:SKILL|Spot,Open Lock,Sleight of Hand|1|TYPE=Racial	AUTO:LANG|Common|Kenderspeak	FAVCLASS:Any	STARTFEATS:1	SAB:+2 racial bonus on Will saves against fear effects.	DESC:Children of kender and humans. Medium; base speed 30 feet. +1 racial bonus on Spot, Open Lock and Sleight of Hand checks; +2 racial bonus on Will saves against fear. Automatic languages Kenderspeak and Common; bonus languages any. Favored class any (the highest-level class does not count for multiclassing). About 5 to 5-1/2 feet tall and 90 to 130 pounds; adult around 16, living about 100 years.	SOURCEPAGE:p.21-23
